  "description": "Apex M7 — Public-Read Router Observability. Binds the 8 normative §4.5 metrics from parallax.apex.router. SLA preview (§4.2): p99 read latency < 100ms. See docs/m7-prep/apex-router-public-read-spec.md v0.1.3-reframe and docs/m7-prep/m7-apex-read-sla-preview.md.",
  "editable": true,
